{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24142","headline":"喜照密闲实四上人见过 · 白居易","name":"喜照密闲实四上人见过","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫袍朝士白髯翁，与俗乖疎与道通。\n官秩三回分洛下，交游一半在僧中。\n臭[帤]世界终须出，香火因缘久愿同。\n斋後将何充供养，西轩泉石北窗风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24142.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24142","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}